\title{tidybrregpanel: Snapshots, Synchronisation and Panels for Norway's Business Registry}
\description{
The managed-state companion to 'tidybrreg'. Saves dated bulk downloads of the Norwegian Central Coordinating Register for Legal Entities (Enhetsregisteret) as Hive-partitioned Parquet snapshots, keeps a local mirror current from the register's change data capture feeds with a persistent changelog, replays updates onto a base extract, and derives firm-period panels, entry and exit flows, aggregate time series, role-change diffs, annotation and name history, director networks and survival data. All retrieval goes through 'tidybrreg'; this package adds persistence and analysis.
